  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed dormer enlargement, with particular reference to its width, massing, and projection beyond the original roofslope, is considered an overly large, non-subordinate and poor quality design&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;with an awkward roof form&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;that fails to integrate with the property overall, and is harmful to the wider roofscape. This is considered contrary to the high-quality design aspirations of the National Planning Policy Framework (2021), Policy D3 Policy of the London Plan (2021); CS.1 of the Harrow Core Strategy (2012), Policy DM1 of the Development Management Plan Local Policies (2013) and the adopted Supplementary Planning Document: Residential Design Guide (2010).&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
